{
 "esm": "1.3.0",
 "metadata": {
  "name": "mosart_coupling",
  "description": "MOSART cap-boundary component (stage 2 of the EqESM project): the med<->rof field conversions of rof_comp_nuopc/rof_import_export.F90 (mosart1.1.13) as algebraic equations, per the stage1/boundaries.md 1.5 boundary table. Imports (med -> rof): Flrl_rofsur, Flrl_rofsub, Flrl_rofgwl, Flrl_rofi, Flrl_irrig (lnd runoff, CMEPS kg/m^2/s which for water equals mm/s), and Fgrg_rofl, Fgrg_rofi (glc runoff, active when rof_from_glc). Exports (rof -> med): Forr_rofl, Forr_rofi, Forr_rofl_glc, Forr_rofi_glc, Flrr_flood, Flrr_volr, Flrr_volrmch, Sr_tdepth, Sr_tdepth_max. Import conversion, exactly state_getimport (rof_import_export.F90:589-595): q [m3/s] = field [mm/s] * med2mod_areacor * area [m2] * 0.001 [m/mm], where med2mod_areacor is the mesh-area correction factor (F90:209-210, ~1 for the rof mesh on the model grid) and 0.001 is spelled as the parameter mm_to_m [m/mm] for dimensional honesty. Export conversion, exactly state_setexport (F90:636-643): field [mm/s] = q [m3/s] * mod2med_areacor / (area [m2] * 0.001 [m/mm]); Flrr_flood carries the sign flip flood = -ctl%flood/(area*0.001) (F90:395, the land->rof positive convention); Flrr_volr = volr/area and Flrr_volrmch = wr/area are depths [m] with no mm scaling (F90:396-397); Sr_tdepth/Sr_tdepth_max are stream depths exported only when flds_r2l_stream_channel_depths (F90:398-402, tdepth_max = max(twidth0,0)*(rdepth/rwidth)). The direct-transfer, irrigation, flood and subcycling orchestration of mosart_run lives in the assembly mosart_routing.esm (its Control model) because the qgwl threshold option and the flood threshold need the channel storage wr; this file keeps the pure unit conversions, per the boundaries.md 2.6 mapping (cap boundary row). The tests block pins the med<->rof import/export unit conversions pointwise (instantaneous tests, time_span {0,0}) from the step-1 boundary values of cell 100312 (mosart_run_imports.csv / mosart_run_exports.csv); see README.md (Testing). Reference: stage1/cesm/components/mosart/src/cpl/nuopc/rof_import_export.F90 (mosart1.1.13).",
   "tags": [
    "environmental_transport",
    "mosart",
    "river-routing",
    "coupler",
    "cmesp",
    "unit-conversion",
    "cesm"
   ],
   "created": "2026-10-26T00:00:00Z",
   "authors": [
    "EqESM project contributors"
   ],
   "references": [
    {
     "citation": "Li, H., Wigmosta, M. S., Wu, H., Huang, M., Ke, Y., Coleman, A. M., and Leung, L. R. (2013). A physically based runoff routing model for land surface and earth system models. Journal of Hydrometeorology, 14(3), 808-828. The MOSART (Model for Scale Adaptive River Transport) routing scheme these components transcribe.",
     "doi": "10.1175/JHM-D-12-015.1"
    },
    {
     "citation": "CESM (Community Earth System Model), ESCOMP/CESM, cesm3.0-alphabranch: MOSART river-routing source (mosart1.1.13) - mosart_physics.F90, mosart_driver.F90, mosart_tstatusflux_type.F90, mosart_tspatialunit_type.F90, rof_comp_nuopc/rof_import_export.F90 - the reference implementation these components are transcribed from.",
     "url": "https://github.com/ESCOMP/CESM"
    },
    {
     "citation": "EarthSciModels - the authoritative .esm corpus this component lives in.",
     "url": "https://github.com/EarthSciML/EarthSciModels"
    }
   ]
 },
 "models": {
  "RofCap": {
   "variables": {
    "qsur_m3s": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "m^3/s",
     "description": "liquid surface runoff stream (ctl%qsur, m3/s) after the cap unit conversion, [m3/s]"
    },
    "qsub_m3s": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "m^3/s",
     "description": "liquid subsurface runoff stream (ctl%qsub, m3/s) after the cap unit conversion, [m3/s]"
    },
    "qgwl_m3s": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "m^3/s",
     "description": "gwl runoff stream (ctl%qgwl, m3/s) after the cap unit conversion, [m3/s]"
    },
    "qirrig_m3s": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "m^3/s",
     "description": "irrigation demand stream (ctl%qirrig, m3/s; negative, a demand) after the cap unit conversion, [m3/s]"
    },
    "qsur_ice_m3s": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "m^3/s",
     "description": "frozen runoff stream (the Flrl_rofi field is loaded into qsur(:,nt_ice), rof_import_export.F90:286-287), always routed directly to the outlet, [m3/s]"
    },
    "qglc_liq_m3s": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "m^3/s",
     "description": "liquid glc runoff stream (ctl%qglc_liq, F90:298-299), active only when rof_from_glc, [m3/s]"
    },
    "qglc_ice_m3s": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "m^3/s",
     "description": "frozen glc runoff stream (ctl%qglc_ice, F90:301-302), active only when rof_from_glc, [m3/s]"
    },
    "Forr_rofl": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "mm/s",
     "description": "liquid river runoff to the ocean (CMEPS kg/m^2/s equivalent), [mm/s]"
    },
    "Forr_rofi": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "mm/s",
     "description": "frozen river runoff to the ocean (CMEPS kg/m^2/s equivalent), [mm/s]"
    },
    "Forr_rofl_glc": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "mm/s",
     "description": "liquid glc runoff to the ocean (CMEPS kg/m^2/s equivalent), [mm/s]"
    },
    "Forr_rofi_glc": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "mm/s",
     "description": "frozen glc runoff to the ocean (CMEPS kg/m^2/s equivalent), [mm/s]"
    },
    "Flrr_flood": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "mm/s",
     "description": "flood water sent back to the land, negative in the land->rof flux convention (F90:389-395), [mm/s]"
    },
    "Flrr_volr": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "m",
     "description": "gridcell-average total water storage sent back to the land (F90:396), [m]"
    },
    "Flrr_volrmch": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "m",
     "description": "gridcell-average main-channel storage sent back to the land (F90:397), [m]"
    },
    "Sr_tdepth": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "m",
     "description": "stream depth (tributary depth yt) for lnd, exported only when flds_r2l_stream_channel_depths (F90:398-399), [m]"
    },
    "Sr_tdepth_max": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "m",
     "description": "maximum stream depth = max(twidth0, 0)*(rdepth/rwidth) (F90:401), exported only when flds_r2l_stream_channel_depths, [m]"
    },
    "Flrl_rofsur": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "units": "mm/s",
     "default": 0.0,
     "description": "lnd surface runoff to rof (CMEPS field name; kg/m^2/s of water = mm/s), [mm/s]"
    },
    "Flrl_rofsub": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "units": "mm/s",
     "default": 0.0,
     "description": "lnd subsurface runoff to rof (CMEPS field name; kg/m^2/s of water = mm/s), [mm/s]"
    },
    "Flrl_rofgwl": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "units": "mm/s",
     "default": 0.0,
     "description": "lnd gwl (glacier/wetland/lake) runoff to rof (CMEPS field name; kg/m^2/s of water = mm/s), [mm/s]"
    },
    "Flrl_rofi": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "units": "mm/s",
     "default": 0.0,
     "description": "lnd frozen runoff to rof (CMEPS field name; kg/m^2/s of water = mm/s), routed directly to the outlet, [mm/s]"
    },
    "Flrl_irrig": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "units": "mm/s",
     "default": -0.0001,
     "description": "lnd irrigation demand to rof (CMEPS field name; kg/m^2/s of water = mm/s; negative, a demand), [mm/s]"
    },
    "Fgrg_rofl": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "units": "mm/s",
     "default": 0.0,
     "description": "glc liquid runoff via rof (CMEPS field name; kg/m^2/s of water = mm/s), active when rof_from_glc, [mm/s]"
    },
    "Fgrg_rofi": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "units": "mm/s",
     "default": 0.0,
     "description": "glc frozen runoff via rof (CMEPS field name; kg/m^2/s of water = mm/s), active when rof_from_glc, [mm/s]"
    },
    "area": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "units": "m^2",
     "default": 10000000.0,
     "description": "area of the local cell (ctl%area), [m2]"
    },
    "mm_to_m": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "units": "m/mm",
     "default": 0.001,
     "description": "millimeters to meters conversion, the 0.001 of state_getimport (rof_import_export.F90:594), spelled with units for dimensional honesty, [m/mm]"
    },
    "med2mod_areacor": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "units": "1",
     "default": 1.0,
     "description": "mesh-to-model area correction factor for fields received from the mediator (rof_import_export.F90:210), ~1 on the rof mesh, [-]"
    },
    "mod2med_areacor": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "units": "1",
     "default": 1.0,
     "description": "model-to-mesh area correction factor for fields sent to the mediator (rof_import_export.F90:209), ~1 on the rof mesh, [-]"
    },
    "rof_from_glc": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "units": "1",
     "default": 0.0,
     "description": "1 when glc runoff is routed through rof (ctl%rof_from_glc), [-]; 0/1 stands in for the Fortran logical"
    },
    "flds_r2l_stream_channel_depths": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "units": "1",
     "default": 0.0,
     "description": "1 when the rof->lnd stream channel depth fields are active (rof_import_export.F90:398), [-]; 0/1 stands in for the Fortran logical"
    },
    "rofl_m3s": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "units": "m^3/s",
     "default": 0.0,
     "description": "liquid runoff to the ocean in m3/s, computed by the assembly Control model (runofftot_liq, ice_runoff branch of F90:362-382), [m3/s]"
    },
    "rofi_m3s": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "units": "m^3/s",
     "default": 0.0,
     "description": "frozen runoff to the ocean in m3/s, computed by the assembly Control model, [m3/s]"
    },
    "rofl_glc_m3s": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "units": "m^3/s",
     "default": 0.0,
     "description": "liquid glc runoff in m3/s, computed by the assembly Control model (direct_glc_liq, F90:385), [m3/s]"
    },
    "rofi_glc_m3s": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "units": "m^3/s",
     "default": 0.0,
     "description": "frozen glc runoff in m3/s, computed by the assembly Control model (direct_glc_ice, F90:386), [m3/s]"
    },
    "flood_m3s": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "units": "m^3/s",
     "default": 0.0,
     "description": "flood flux in m3/s, computed by the assembly Control model (ctl%flood, F90:516), [m3/s]"
    },
    "volr_m3": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "units": "m^3",
     "default": 0.0,
     "description": "total water storage in m3, computed by the assembly Control model (ctl%volr = wt + wr + wh*area, F90:854), [m3]"
    },
    "volrmch_m3": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "units": "m^3",
     "default": 0.0,
     "description": "main-channel storage in m3, computed by the assembly Control model (TRunoff%wr), [m3]"
    },
    "tdepth_m": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "units": "m",
     "default": 0.0,
     "description": "stream depth (tributary depth yt) in m, computed by the assembly Control model, [m]"
    },
    "tdepth_max_m": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "units": "m",
     "default": 0.0,
     "description": "maximum stream depth in m, computed by the assembly Control model, [m]"
    }
   },
   "equations": [
    {
     "lhs": "qsur_m3s",
     "rhs": { "op": "*", "args": ["Flrl_rofsur", "med2mod_areacor", "area", "mm_to_m"] }
    },
    {
     "lhs": "qsub_m3s",
     "rhs": { "op": "*", "args": ["Flrl_rofsub", "med2mod_areacor", "area", "mm_to_m"] }
    },
    {
     "lhs": "qgwl_m3s",
     "rhs": { "op": "*", "args": ["Flrl_rofgwl", "med2mod_areacor", "area", "mm_to_m"] }
    },
    {
     "lhs": "qirrig_m3s",
     "rhs": { "op": "*", "args": ["Flrl_irrig", "med2mod_areacor", "area", "mm_to_m"] }
    },
    {
     "lhs": "qsur_ice_m3s",
     "rhs": { "op": "*", "args": ["Flrl_rofi", "med2mod_areacor", "area", "mm_to_m"] }
    },
    {
     "lhs": "qglc_liq_m3s",
     "rhs": { "op": "ifelse", "args": [
       { "op": "==", "args": ["rof_from_glc", 1.0] },
       { "op": "*", "args": ["Fgrg_rofl", "med2mod_areacor", "area", "mm_to_m"] },
       0.0 ] }
    },
    {
     "lhs": "qglc_ice_m3s",
     "rhs": { "op": "ifelse", "args": [
       { "op": "==", "args": ["rof_from_glc", 1.0] },
       { "op": "*", "args": ["Fgrg_rofi", "med2mod_areacor", "area", "mm_to_m"] },
       0.0 ] }
    },
    {
     "lhs": "Forr_rofl",
     "rhs": { "op": "/", "args": [
       { "op": "*", "args": ["rofl_m3s", "mod2med_areacor"] },
       { "op": "*", "args": ["area", "mm_to_m"] } ] }
    },
    {
     "lhs": "Forr_rofi",
     "rhs": { "op": "/", "args": [
       { "op": "*", "args": ["rofi_m3s", "mod2med_areacor"] },
       { "op": "*", "args": ["area", "mm_to_m"] } ] }
    },
    {
     "lhs": "Forr_rofl_glc",
     "rhs": { "op": "/", "args": [
       { "op": "*", "args": ["rofl_glc_m3s", "mod2med_areacor"] },
       { "op": "*", "args": ["area", "mm_to_m"] } ] }
    },
    {
     "lhs": "Forr_rofi_glc",
     "rhs": { "op": "/", "args": [
       { "op": "*", "args": ["rofi_glc_m3s", "mod2med_areacor"] },
       { "op": "*", "args": ["area", "mm_to_m"] } ] }
    },
    {
     "lhs": "Flrr_flood",
     "rhs": { "op": "-", "args": [
       { "op": "/", "args": [
         { "op": "*", "args": ["flood_m3s", "mod2med_areacor"] },
         { "op": "*", "args": ["area", "mm_to_m"] } ] } ] }
    },
    {
     "lhs": "Flrr_volr",
     "rhs": { "op": "*", "args": [
       { "op": "/", "args": ["volr_m3", "area"] },
       "mod2med_areacor" ] }
    },
    {
     "lhs": "Flrr_volrmch",
     "rhs": { "op": "*", "args": [
       { "op": "/", "args": ["volrmch_m3", "area"] },
       "mod2med_areacor" ] }
    },
    {
     "lhs": "Sr_tdepth",
     "rhs": { "op": "ifelse", "args": [
       { "op": "==", "args": ["flds_r2l_stream_channel_depths", 1.0] },
       { "op": "*", "args": ["tdepth_m", "mod2med_areacor"] },
       0.0 ] }
    },
    {
     "lhs": "Sr_tdepth_max",
     "rhs": { "op": "ifelse", "args": [
       { "op": "==", "args": ["flds_r2l_stream_channel_depths", 1.0] },
       { "op": "*", "args": ["tdepth_max_m", "mod2med_areacor"] },
       0.0 ] }
    }
   ],
   "tests": [
    {
     "id": "cap_conversions_step1_cell100312",
     "description": "Instantaneous pin of the med<->rof unit conversions (rof_comp_nuopc/rof_import_export.F90:589-595 state_getimport, 636-643 state_setexport) from the step-1 boundary values of cell 100312. Import side: the cap surface-runoff stream qsur = 7.51365591037279353e-05 m3/s of mosart_run_imports.csv row (step 1, nt 1, nr 1, gindex 100312) corresponds to a land flux Flrl_rofsur = qsur/(area*mm_to_m) = 2.59072497089951852e-11 mm/s over area = 2.900213644740529e9 m2 (the qsur_m3s/qsur_ms ratio of the step-1 dump rows) and med2mod_areacor = 1; the other streams are zero in the run (qsub = qgwl = qirrig = qglc_liq = qglc_ice = 0 in the same row, so Flrl_rofsub = Flrl_rofgwl = Flrl_irrig = Fgrg_rofl = Fgrg_rofi = 0). Export side: the step-1 end-of-period states of mosart_run_exports.csv row (1,1,100312), volr = 8.11474838320261793e-01 m3 and volrmch = 9.03380478061898422e-26 m3, give the gridcell-average depths Flrr_volr = volr/area = 2.7979829685714803e-10 m and Flrr_volrmch = volrmch/area = 3.1148756220086e-35 m (F90:396-397, no mm scaling); with all runoff and flood streams zero in that row (runofftot = 0, flood = 0), Forr_rofl = Forr_rofi = Forr_rofl_glc = Forr_rofi_glc = 0 and Flrr_flood = 0. time_span {0,0} evaluates the conversions pointwise; the Fortran values are reproduced to round-off (rel 1e-12).",
     "time_span": {"start": 0.0, "end": 0.0},
     "parameter_overrides": {
      "Flrl_rofsur": 2.5907249708995185e-11,
      "Flrl_rofsub": 0.0,
      "Flrl_rofgwl": 0.0,
      "Flrl_irrig": 0.0,
      "Flrl_rofi": 0.0,
      "Fgrg_rofl": 0.0,
      "Fgrg_rofi": 0.0,
      "area": 2900213644.740529,
      "rofl_m3s": 0.0,
      "rofi_m3s": 0.0,
      "rofl_glc_m3s": 0.0,
      "rofi_glc_m3s": 0.0,
      "flood_m3s": 0.0,
      "volr_m3": 0.8114748383202618,
      "volrmch_m3": 9.033804780618984e-26,
      "tdepth_m": 0.0,
      "tdepth_max_m": 0.0
     },
     "tolerance": {"rel": 1e-12, "abs": 1e-40},
     "assertions": [
      {"variable": "qsur_m3s", "time": 0.0, "expected": 7.513655910372794e-05},
      {"variable": "qsub_m3s", "time": 0.0, "expected": 0.0},
      {"variable": "qgwl_m3s", "time": 0.0, "expected": 0.0},
      {"variable": "qirrig_m3s", "time": 0.0, "expected": 0.0},
      {"variable": "qsur_ice_m3s", "time": 0.0, "expected": 0.0},
      {"variable": "qglc_liq_m3s", "time": 0.0, "expected": 0.0},
      {"variable": "qglc_ice_m3s", "time": 0.0, "expected": 0.0},
      {"variable": "Forr_rofl", "time": 0.0, "expected": 0.0},
      {"variable": "Forr_rofi", "time": 0.0, "expected": 0.0},
      {"variable": "Forr_rofl_glc", "time": 0.0, "expected": 0.0},
      {"variable": "Forr_rofi_glc", "time": 0.0, "expected": 0.0},
      {"variable": "Flrr_flood", "time": 0.0, "expected": 0.0},
      {"variable": "Flrr_volr", "time": 0.0, "expected": 2.7979829685714803e-10},
      {"variable": "Flrr_volrmch", "time": 0.0, "expected": 3.1148756220086e-35},
      {"variable": "Sr_tdepth", "time": 0.0, "expected": 0.0},
      {"variable": "Sr_tdepth_max", "time": 0.0, "expected": 0.0}
     ]
    }
   ]
  }
 }
}
